function courseDetailPage(l,i){const k=localeKey(l),p=products[i],t=courseDetailText(k),name=productNames[k][i],desc=courseDescription(k,i),unit=courseUnit(k,i),duration=courseDuration(k,i,p[1]),faq=faqData(k).slice(0,5),message=`${l.msg}. ${name}, ${duration}, ${p[2]}${unit?' '+unit:''}.`,visual=courseVisuals[i];const body=hero(name,desc,visual,[t.book,wa(message)])+`<section class="section"><div class="prose"><p class="eyebrow">${duration} · ${p[2]}${unit?' · '+unit:''}</p><h2>${t.includes}</h2><div class="insight-grid">${courseFeatures[i].map((x,j)=>`<article class="insight-card"><h3>✓ ${featureName(k,x,j)}</h3></article>`).join('')}</div><h2>${t.process}</h2><p>${t.processText}</p><img class="visual" src="/images/${visual}" alt="${esc(name)}" width="1280" height="800"><h2>${t.ideal}</h2><p>${t.idealText}</p>${guideDepth(k,i===8?'beginner':i>=11?'gear':'booking')}<div class="actions"><a class="btn primary" href="${wa(message)}">${t.book}</a><a class="card-link" href="${href(l,coreSlug(l,'courses'))}">← ${t.back}</a></div></div></section>${contactBlock(l)}`;return shell(l,{title:`${name} | Kite Cartagena`,desc,urlPath:href(l,'curso/'+courseSlugs[i]),body,faq,heroImage:visual,slugFn:x=>href(x,'curso/'+courseSlugs[i])})}

const depthCopy={
 es:{title:'Una decisión bien informada',intro:'Una buena experiencia no empieza al llegar a la playa. Empieza al comparar el objetivo, el nivel real, el tiempo disponible, las condiciones y lo que incluye el servicio. Esta guía convierte esos factores en un proceso sencillo para evitar expectativas equivocadas y tomar decisiones útiles antes de reservar.',cards:[['Objetivo','Define si buscas una primera experiencia, progresión técnica, práctica supervisada o autonomía. Cada objetivo exige un formato, un tiempo y un acompañamiento distintos.'],['Condiciones','La temporada orienta, pero el viento, el oleaje, la marea, el espacio y la afluencia se revisan nuevamente para el día y la zona concreta.'],['Equipo','Talla, estado, compatibilidad y sistema de seguridad deben corresponder a la persona y a las condiciones. No basta con que el equipo esté disponible.'],['Logística','Confirma punto de encuentro, transporte, duración efectiva, política por clima, inclusiones, precio final y canal de contacto antes de desplazarte.']],steps:['Describe tu caso','Compara opciones','Confirma condiciones','Decide y reserva'],check:'Lista interactiva antes de reservar',checks:['Compartí fechas, nivel, peso aproximado y número de personas.','Entendí qué incluye el precio y qué se paga por separado.','Confirmé punto de encuentro, duración y política por cambios de clima.','Sé que la condición del día prevalece sobre cualquier promedio mensual.'],note:'La decisión más segura puede ser adaptar el ejercicio, cambiar el horario o reprogramar. Eso no es un fallo del servicio: es parte de una operación responsable.'},
 en:{title:'A well-informed decision',intro:'A strong experience begins before reaching the beach. Compare your goal, actual level, available time, conditions and the service scope. This guide turns those variables into a practical process that prevents mismatched expectations and supports a useful booking decision.',cards:[['Goal','Clarify whether you want a first experience, technical progression, supervised practice or independence. Each goal requires a different format and amount of support.'],['Conditions','Seasonality is only a starting point. Wind, waves, tide, usable space and beach traffic must be checked again for the specific day and area.'],['Equipment','Size, condition, compatibility and the safety system must suit the rider and the conditions. Availability alone is not enough.'],['Logistics','Confirm meeting point, transport, effective duration, weather policy, inclusions, final price and contact channel before travelling.']],steps:['Describe your case','Compare options','Confirm conditions','Decide and book'],check:'Interactive pre-booking checklist',checks:['I shared dates, level, approximate weight and party size.','I understand what the price includes and what is separate.','I confirmed meeting point, duration and the weather-change policy.','I know current conditions take priority over monthly averages.'],note:'The safest choice may be to adapt the exercise, change the time or reschedule. That is part of responsible operations, not a service failure.'},
 fr:{title:'Une décision bien informée',intro:'Une bonne expérience commence avant la plage. Comparez objectif, niveau réel, temps disponible, conditions et contenu du service. Ce processus réduit les attentes imprécises et aide à réserver une option cohérente.',cards:[['Objectif','Précisez première expérience, progression technique, pratique encadrée ou autonomie : chaque objectif demande un format différent.'],['Conditions','La saison donne une tendance ; vent, vagues, marée, espace et fréquentation se vérifient pour le jour et la zone.'],['Matériel','Taille, état, compatibilité et sécurité doivent convenir à la personne et aux conditions.'],['Logistique','Confirmez rendez-vous, transport, durée, politique météo, inclusions et prix final.']],steps:['Décrire le besoin','Comparer','Confirmer','Réserver'],check:'Liste interactive avant réservation',checks:['J’ai indiqué dates, niveau, poids approximatif et groupe.','Je connais les inclusions et suppléments.','J’ai confirmé rendez-vous, durée et politique météo.','Je sais que les conditions du jour priment sur les moyennes.'],note:'Adapter l’exercice, changer l’heure ou reporter peut être la décision la plus responsable.'},
 de:{title:'Eine fundierte Entscheidung',intro:'Eine gute Erfahrung beginnt vor dem Strand. Vergleiche Ziel, tatsächliches Level, verfügbare Zeit, Bedingungen und Leistungsumfang. So werden Erwartungen klar und die Buchung passt zur realen Situation.',cards:[['Ziel','Erste Erfahrung, Technik, betreutes Üben oder Selbstständigkeit brauchen unterschiedliche Formate.'],['Bedingungen','Saisonwerte sind Orientierung; Wind, Wellen, Tide, Platz und Betrieb werden für Tag und Bereich geprüft.'],['Material','Größe, Zustand, Kompatibilität und Sicherheitssystem müssen zu Person und Bedingungen passen.'],['Logistik','Treffpunkt, Transfer, Dauer, Wetterregel, Leistungen und Endpreis vor Abfahrt bestätigen.']],steps:['Bedarf schildern','Optionen vergleichen','Bedingungen prüfen','Entscheiden'],check:'Interaktive Checkliste',checks:['Daten, Level, Gewicht und Gruppengröße sind übermittelt.','Leistungen und Zusatzkosten sind klar.','Treffpunkt, Dauer und Wetterregel sind bestätigt.','Tagesbedingungen haben Vorrang vor Monatsmitteln.'],note:'Übung, Uhrzeit oder Termin anzupassen kann die verantwortungsvollste Entscheidung sein.'},
 pt:{title:'Uma decisão bem informada',intro:'Uma boa experiência começa antes da praia. Compare objetivo, nível real, tempo, condições e escopo do serviço para alinhar expectativas e reservar com critério.',cards:[['Objetivo','Primeira experiência, evolução técnica, prática supervisionada ou autonomia exigem formatos diferentes.'],['Condições','A estação orienta; vento, ondas, maré, espaço e movimento são revistos para o dia e a área.'],['Equipamento','Tamanho, estado, compatibilidade e segurança devem combinar com a pessoa e as condições.'],['Logística','Confirme encontro, transporte, duração, política climática, inclusões e preço final.']],steps:['Descrever','Comparar','Confirmar','Reservar'],check:'Checklist interativo',checks:['Enviei datas, nível, peso aproximado e número de pessoas.','Entendi inclusões e custos separados.','Confirmei encontro, duração e política climática.','Sei que a condição do dia vale mais que a média mensal.'],note:'Adaptar, mudar o horário ou remarcar pode ser a decisão mais responsável.'},
 it:{title:'Una decisione informata',intro:'Una buona esperienza inizia prima della spiaggia. Confronta obiettivo, livello, tempo, condizioni e servizio per prenotare con aspettative corrette.',cards:[['Obiettivo','Prima esperienza, progresso, pratica assistita e autonomia richiedono formati diversi.'],['Condizioni','La stagione orienta; vento, onde, marea e spazio si verificano per giorno e zona.'],['Attrezzatura','Misura, stato, compatibilità e sicurezza devono essere adatti.'],['Logistica','Conferma incontro, trasporto, durata, meteo, inclusioni e prezzo finale.']],steps:['Descrivi','Confronta','Conferma','Prenota'],check:'Checklist interattiva',checks:['Ho inviato date, livello, peso e gruppo.','Conosco inclusioni e extra.','Ho confermato incontro, durata e regole meteo.','Le condizioni attuali prevalgono sulle medie.'],note:'Adattare, cambiare orario o riprogrammare può essere la scelta più responsabile.'},
 ru:{title:'Обоснованное решение',intro:'Хорошая поездка начинается до пляжа. Сопоставьте цель, реальный уровень, время, условия и состав услуги, чтобы избежать неверных ожиданий.',cards:[['Цель','Первый опыт, техника, практика с инструктором и самостоятельность требуют разных форматов.'],['Условия','Сезон дает ориентир; ветер, волны, прилив и место проверяются на конкретный день.'],['Снаряжение','Размер, состояние, совместимость и безопасность должны подходить человеку.'],['Логистика','Подтвердите встречу, трансфер, длительность, погодные правила и итоговую цену.']],steps:['Опишите задачу','Сравните','Подтвердите','Бронируйте'],check:'Интерактивный список',checks:['Я сообщил даты, уровень, вес и число участников.','Я понимаю включения и доплаты.','Подтверждены место, длительность и погодные правила.','Текущие условия важнее средних значений.'],note:'Изменить упражнение, время или дату иногда является самым ответственным решением.'},
 zh:{title:'做出充分了解的决定',intro:'优质体验从到达海滩之前开始。应综合目标、真实水平、可用时间、当天条件和服务范围，避免错误预期。',cards:[['目标','初次体验、技术提升、监督练习和独立滑行需要不同安排。'],['条件','季节仅供参考；具体日期仍需检查风、浪、潮汐和可用空间。'],['装备','尺寸、状态、兼容性和安全系统必须适合参与者。'],['安排','出发前确认集合、交通、时长、天气政策、包含项目和总价。']],steps:['说明情况','比较方案','确认条件','决定预订'],check:'预订前互动清单',checks:['已提供日期、水平、约重和人数。','已了解包含内容与额外费用。','已确认集合、时长和天气政策。','已知当天条件优先于月度平均。'],note:'调整练习、改变时间或改期可能是最负责任的选择。'},
 ko:{title:'충분한 정보를 바탕으로 결정하기',intro:'좋은 경험은 해변에 도착하기 전에 시작됩니다. 목표, 실제 수준, 시간, 당일 조건과 서비스 범위를 함께 비교하세요.',cards:[['목표','첫 경험, 기술 향상, 감독 연습, 독립 라이딩에는 다른 방식이 필요합니다.'],['조건','계절은 참고이며 풍속, 파도, 조류와 공간은 당일 다시 확인합니다.'],['장비','크기, 상태, 호환성과 안전 시스템이 참가자에게 맞아야 합니다.'],['이동','집결지, 이동, 실제 시간, 기상 정책, 포함 사항과 총액을 확인합니다.']],steps:['상황 설명','옵션 비교','조건 확인','예약 결정'],check:'예약 전 체크리스트',checks:['날짜, 수준, 체중과 인원을 보냈습니다.','포함 사항과 별도 비용을 이해했습니다.','집결지, 시간과 기상 정책을 확인했습니다.','당일 조건이 월평균보다 중요함을 압니다.'],note:'연습, 시간 또는 날짜 변경이 가장 책임 있는 결정일 수 있습니다.'},
 ja:{title:'十分な情報に基づく判断',intro:'良い体験はビーチに着く前から始まります。目的、実際のレベル、時間、当日の状況、サービス範囲を比較してください。',cards:[['目的','初体験、技術向上、監督付き練習、自立では必要な形式が異なります。'],['条件','季節は目安です。風、波、潮、スペースを当日確認します。'],['用具','サイズ、状態、互換性、安全システムが参加者に合う必要があります。'],['移動','集合、移動、実時間、天候規定、含有項目、総額を確認します。']],steps:['状況を伝える','比較する','確認する','予約する'],check:'予約前チェックリスト',checks:['日程、レベル、体重、人数を共有しました。','含まれる内容と追加費用を理解しました。','集合、時間、天候規定を確認しました。','月平均より当日の状況が優先されると理解しました。'],note:'内容、時間、日程を変更することが最も責任ある判断の場合があります。'}
};
function guideDepth(k,tag='planning'){const c=depthCopy[k],detail=tagDetail(k,tag),scores=[92,78,86,70];return `<section class="guide-depth"><h2>${c.title}</h2><p>${c.intro}</p><div class="insight-grid">${c.cards.map(([h,p])=>`<article class="insight-card"><h3>${h}</h3><p>${p}</p></article>`).join('')}</div><div id="decision-visual" class="visual-balance" role="img" aria-label="${esc(c.title)}"><h3>${c.title}</h3>${c.cards.map(([h],i)=>`<div class="balance-row"><span>${h}</span><i><b style="--score:${scores[i]}%"></b></i><strong>${scores[i]}%</strong></div>`).join('')}</div><h2>${c.steps[0]} → ${c.steps[3]}</h2><div class="decision-meter">${c.steps.map((s,i)=>`<div class="decision-step"><strong>0${i+1}</strong>${s}</div>`).join('')}</div><p>${detail} ${topicAdvice(k,tag)}</p><div class="interactive-checklist"><h3>${c.check}</h3>${c.checks.map(x=>`<label><input type="checkbox"> <span>${x}</span></label>`).join('')}</div><p class="guide-note"><strong>${c.note}</strong></p></section>`}
const proseShort=prose;
prose=(k,title,desc)=>proseShort(k,title,desc)+guideDepth(k,'planning');

const faqBrief=faqData;
faqData=(k)=>faqBrief(k).map(([q,a],i)=>[q,`${a} ${depthCopy[k].cards[i%4][1]} ${i===1||i===2?depthCopy[k].note:''}`]);

const shellBeforeSearchFix=shell;
shell=(l,opts)=>{const k=localeKey(l);if(opts.article){const tag=(opts.body.match(/JOURNAL · ([^<]+)/)||[])[1]?.toLowerCase()||'planning';const canonicalTag=Object.entries(tagTranslations[k]).find(([,v])=>v.toLowerCase()===tag)?.[0]||'planning';opts={...opts,body:opts.body.replace('<h2><a href=',guideDepth(k,canonicalTag)+'<h2><a href=')}}return shellBeforeSearchFix(l,opts).replace("featuredCards.forEach(c=>c.hidden=!!q||category!=='all'||!match(c))","featuredCards.forEach(c=>c.hidden=!match(c))")};
const shellWithContent=shell;
shell=(l,opts)=>{let html=shellWithContent(l,opts).replace('<body>','<body><div class="reading-progress" aria-hidden="true"><i></i></div>');const motion=`<button class="back-to-top" type="button" aria-label="Back to top">↑</button><script>(()=>{const root=document.documentElement,bar=document.querySelector('.reading-progress i'),topButton=document.querySelector('.back-to-top'),reduce=matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;const update=()=>{const max=root.scrollHeight-innerHeight,p=max>0?scrollY/max:0;bar.style.transform='scaleX('+Math.min(1,Math.max(0,p))+')';topButton.classList.toggle('visible',scrollY>650)};addEventListener('scroll',update,{passive:true});update();topButton.addEventListener('click',()=>scrollTo({top:0,behavior:reduce?'auto':'smooth'}));if(!reduce&&'IntersectionObserver'in window){root.classList.add('motion-ready');const targets=document.querySelectorAll('.hero-copy,.section-head,.course-card,.blog-card,.spot-card,.feature-card,.insight-card,.decision-meter,.visual-balance,.interactive-checklist,.faq-list details,.visual');targets.forEach((el,i)=>{el.classList.add('reveal');el.style.setProperty('--reveal-delay',Math.min(i%6,5)*55+'ms')});const io=new IntersectionObserver(entries=>entries.forEach(entry=>{if(entry.isIntersecting){entry.target.classList.add('in-view');io.unobserve(entry.target)}}),{threshold:.08,rootMargin:'0px 0px -6%'});targets.forEach(el=>io.observe(el))}})();</script>`;return html.replace('</body>',motion+'</body>')};
const shellWithMotion=shell;
shell=(l,opts)=>{let html=shellWithMotion(l,opts),k=localeKey(l),tag='';if(opts.urlPath===href(l,methodSlugs[k]))tag='safety';if(opts.urlPath===href(l,coreSlug(l,'contact')))tag='booking';if(tag)html=html.replace('</main>',`<section class="section alt"><div class="prose">${guideDepth(k,tag)}</div></section></main>`);return html};

for(const l of Object.values(locales)){
 const base=path.join(root,l.prefix);fs.mkdirSync(base,{recursive:true});fs.writeFileSync(path.join(base,'index.html'),home(l));
 const k=localeKey(l);const outputs=[['courses',coreSlug(l,'courses'),courses(l)],['spots',coreSlug(l,'spots'),standardPage(l,'spots')],['wind',coreSlug(l,'wind'),standardPage(l,'wind')],['beginner',coreSlug(l,'beginner'),standardPage(l,'beginner')],['travel',l.travel,standardPage(l,'travel')],['repair',repairSlugs[k],repairPage(l)],['method',methodSlugs[k],methodologyPage(l)],['contact',coreSlug(l,'contact'),contactPage(l)],['faq',l.faq,faqPage(l)],['blog','blog',blogIndex(l)]];
 for(const[,slug,html]of outputs){const dir=path.join(base,slug);fs.mkdirSync(dir,{recursive:true});fs.writeFileSync(path.join(dir,'index.html'),html)}
 articles.forEach((a,i)=>{const dir=path.join(base,'blog',a[0]);fs.mkdirSync(dir,{recursive:true});fs.writeFileSync(path.join(dir,'index.html'),a[0]==='kite-repair'?repairGuideArticle(l,a):articlePage(l,a,i))});
 products.forEach((p,i)=>{const dir=path.join(base,'curso',courseSlugs[i]);fs.mkdirSync(dir,{recursive:true});fs.writeFileSync(path.join(dir,'index.html'),courseDetailPage(l,i))});
}

const urls=[];for(const l of Object.values(locales)){const k=localeKey(l);urls.push(domain+href(l));for(const s of [...l.slugs,l.travel,l.faq,repairSlugs[k],methodSlugs[k]])urls.push(domain+href(l,s));for(const a of articles)urls.push(domain+href(l,'blog/'+a[0]));for(const s of courseSlugs)urls.push(domain+href(l,'curso/'+s));}
fs.writeFileSync(path.join(root,'sitemap.xml'),`<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>\n<urlset xmlns="http://www.sitemaps.org/schemas/sitemap/0.9">\n${[...new Set(urls)].map(u=>`<url><loc>${u}</loc><lastmod>2026-09-15</lastmod></url>`).join('\n')}\n</urlset>`);
fs.writeFileSync(path.join(root,'robots.txt'),`User-agent: *\nAllow: /\n\nSitemap: ${domain}/sitemap.xml\n`);
console.log(`Generated ${new Set(urls).size} localized URLs.`);
